---
description: RMH QA suite runner project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is an internal RMH QA tool.

Core behavior:
- Markdown files in /testcases are the source of truth
- Only scan /testcases
- Include only files whose filename contains the exact suite name string, case-sensitive
- Test cases are split by the exact marker: # Scenario:
- Each scenario is exactly one test case
- Never merge scenarios
- Never deduplicate scenarios
- Preserve file order and scenario order

Technical rules:
- Use Next.js App Router
- Use TypeScript
- Use Tailwind for styling
- Use Node fs and path for file access
- Avoid unnecessary external libraries
- Prefer simple deterministic logic over abstractions
- Do not add a database
- Do not add auth
- Do not add persistence unless explicitly requested

Coding rules:
- Keep code readable
- Do not modify unrelated files
- Explain the plan briefly before coding